<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-24T23:34:15.903Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:34:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Iraqi prime minister has ordered the ministry to take direct control of oilfields in areas held by Kurdish parties, prompting the KDP and PUK to unite in opposition and warn Baghdad against unilateral decisions. Security forces have dismissed the border crossings chief and a border official, installed new commanders in Kirkuk, and seized trucks in a fuel smuggling operation. Iraqi security also seized two drone launchers in Maysan and reported a drone hit an Azadi camp minutes after a missile strike. 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQV0tJbURiRHU3WF85OHFic1Z2OUFGUzRZa3FfdGxhRkhjdDlWY3B2dXFHV21VWEhfam84aTByUXVMSmRGTTRJWk9lZTBIVFlDai10VXE5U1hrUTBGdmFnNTd1Z1hrdlptcWlLY2JicURSbnh6Q1lVazFKTmhCNmNwazFMc0pGblk0cU5KaXktcl9mU29UMjUxdXRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQT0ttY1ZZa0d3ajhmMUVZYmhrdHNGd0E4aC0wQWswZzc0UkFrcndsZ3pJUkJQMVF3Rlp0cjdGdkc2bG5XY093OWx6QWdtQVlJMVpRN2QzUUZicGRBZEROT2JUZEdQUTRpWHBpYzNXMVVwN1FQbmZpVmZfTm1leHQzclpZSkdsRk9MWHBzZEpaSlFoVjd0QzZQMnl2SDladHhlTzFmYkhmT2xPSlRTc2o2VmY2ZThoQ0dxbl94NXAxaXFWTHBNb1V6bzhXRTFPQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNdFQtVTRNaHQ0VDNsenhqUndQQmNLaDFyMF9uTjhrNXZTY0RUUnVERVJ5SGlRRnlMNlpVclJQb3hjSGZtNTY5RjE3UTlQZnJvUmRyTDU4Nm5rNHVaSTREUmt2Vmd6N21BNEstSENvUWQ0YmdzTFhGS0I1RFFwTWR2VDRUb0I?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crisisgroup.org/qna/asia-pacific/myanmar/world-court-finds-myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya&quot;&gt;International Crisis Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilA